    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Unknown_Regions\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Unknown Regions\">Star Wars Saga Edition Unknown Regions</a></i></p><p><i>See also:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a></i></p><p>You have gained the wisdom of elders, whether through your own experiences or by learning from their instruction.</p><p><b>Prerequisite:</b> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Skill_Focus_(Knowledge_(Galactic_Lore))\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Skill Focus (Knowledge (Galactic Lore))\">Skill Focus (Knowledge (Galactic Lore))</a> or <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Skill_Focus_(Knowledge_(Social_Sciences))\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Skill Focus (Knowledge (Social Sciences))\">Skill Focus (Knowledge (Social Sciences))</a></p><p><b>Effect:</b> Once per encounter, you can substitute a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Knowledge_(Galactic_Lore)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Knowledge (Galactic Lore)\">Knowledge (Galactic Lore)</a> or <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Knowledge_(Social_Sciences)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Knowledge (Social Sciences)\">Knowledge (Social Sciences)</a> check for a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Wisdom\" title=\"Wisdom\">Wisdom</a> or <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Wisdom\" title=\"Wisdom\">Wisdom</a>-related check.</p>",
